sequenceDiagram
    actor Agent as AI agent
    participant CLI as sshai
    participant SSH as system OpenSSH
    participant Host as Linux bash or selected Windows PowerShell
    participant Store as local artifact store

    Agent->>Agent: prepare authorized request
    Agent->>CLI: sshai run
    CLI->>SSH: stage and execute on one or more hosts
    SSH->>Host: run in the selected shell
    Host-->>SSH: stdout, stderr, and exit status
    SSH-->>CLI: captured streams and outcome
    CLI->>Store: persist captured output and metadata
    CLI-->>Agent: bounded passport or JSON
    Agent->>CLI: q, diff, log, or --delta
    CLI->>Store: request selected evidence
    Store-->>CLI: requested slice
    CLI-->>Agent: bounded evidence
